我不会抱你的
I'm not hugging you.

207
00:12:26,980 --> 00:12:28,260
你们准备好了没
You guys ready or what?

208
00:12:30,370 --> 00:12:32,870
-没有  没有
- No. - No.

209
00:12:33,340 --> 00:12:34,580
我听着也是
Sounds about right.

210
00:12:54,830 --> 00:12:57,110
-应该就在前面了  -好
- It should be right up ahead. - Okay.

211
00:12:59,880 --> 00:13:01,580
克莱尔  我要说一下
Claire, for what it's worth,

212
00:13:01,870 --> 00:13:04,510
我知道卢克他们有超能力  但你也有
I know Luke and the other guys have abilities, but so do you.

213
00:13:04,930 --> 00:13:05,890
什么
What?

214
