让我夺走她  来提醒你  你究竟是谁
let me remind you who you really are by taking that away.

347
00:27:46,930 --> 00:27:48,010
科琳
Colleen!

348
00:27:50,060 --> 00:27:53,370
她失血过多  我们会照顾你的  好吗
She's losing too much blood. We're gonna take care of you, okay?

349
