你保证会带他回去的  别食言
You made a promise to get him back. You better keep your word.

355
00:29:07,880 --> 00:29:09,030
走吧  各位
Come on, guys.

356
00:29:15,850 --> 00:29:17,210
我就来  去吧
I'm right behind you. Go.

357
00:29:17,810 --> 00:29:18,870
快走
Let's go!

358
00:29:48,940 --> 00:29:51,320
你不再躲在你的朋友身后了
Are you done hiding behind your friends?

359
00:29:52,540 --> 00:29:54,460
是你在躲藏  艾丽卡
You're the one who's hiding, Elektra.

360
00:29:55,110 --> 00:29:56,780
你想要什么  马修
What do you want, Matthew?

361
