It's not too late to stop fighting.

368
00:30:43,920 --> 00:30:45,520
我们还可以走出去
We can still walk out of here.

369
00:30:45,530 --> 00:30:46,500
一起出去
Together.

370
00:30:49,780 --> 00:30:50,470
就像你之前想要的那样
Just like you wanted to before.

371
00:30:54,180 --> 00:30:56,300
你让我死之前吗
Before you let me die?

372
